[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3924042035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116449#issuecomment-3924042035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116449","id":3924042035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7p5CEz","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T00:43:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T00:43:59Z","body":"This works as intended, not a bug. It returns the position in the GridMap's \"object local\" coordinate space.\n\n```gdscript\n# In GridMap/self coordinate space:\nmap_to_local(cell_coords)\n\n# In parent coordinate space:\ntransform * map_to_local(cell_coords)\n\n# In global coordinate space:\nglobal_transform * map_to_local(cell_coords)\n# Same as above:\nto_global(map_to_local(cell_coords))\n```\n\nWhat could be clarified in the docs is that it returns position of the center of the cell.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ad4c2c3da892029981707d757a80ddef12e59d7a/modules/gridmap/doc_classes/GridMap.xml#L136-L141","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3924042035/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]